### Setup for Claude Desktop

Add to your Claude Desktop MCP settings:

```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "airweave": {
      "command": "python",
      "args": ["-m", "airweave.mcp"],
      "env": {
        "AIRWEAVE_API_KEY": "your-api-key",
        "AIRWEAVE_COLLECTION": "your-collection-id"
      }
    }
  }
}
```

